22", "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions: <Subject 1> is the elderly male cultivator from <Picture 1>, with long wild grey-white hair and beard, deeply wrinkled face with a scar across the forehead, wearing tattered ragged grey robes, heavy iron chains shackled to both ankles, weathered bare feet, and a primal, ancient aura. <Subject 2> is the young female cultivator from <Picture 2>, with long straight black hair and bangs, wearing elegant dark green xianxia robes with gold embroidery and flowing blue sheer sleeves, a gold necklace with jade pendant, matching gold jade earrings, and a refined, graceful bearing. <Picture 1> is the character design reference for <Subject 1>, defining his facial features, hairstyle, clothing, and overall silhouette. <Picture 2> is the character design reference for <Subject 2>, defining her facial features, hairstyle, clothing details, and accessories.\n\nsummary: [reference generation] The target video is a 15-second cinematic xianxia sword duel on a snow-covered mountain peak. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> face off with swords, clashing on the ground first, then exchanging multiple rounds of mid-air combat above the peak, and finally locking blades in an even draw. Both character appearances are derived from their respective reference images while the snowy mountain environment and battle actions are newly generated.\n\nretention_analysis: <Subject 1> (appears throughout [Shot 1]–[Shot 4]): fully_preserved — the elderly cultivator's grey-white hair and beard, wrinkled scarred face, tattered grey robes, and ankle shackles are all retained exactly as referenced. <Subject 2> (appears throughout [Shot 1]–[Shot 4]): fully_preserved — the female cultivator's black hair with bangs, dark green embroidered robes, blue sheer sleeves, and gold jade accessories are all retained exactly as referenced. <Picture 1> (character reference for <Subject 1>): attribute_transfer — the character's visual attributes are transferred to the snowy battle environment with new poses and actions. <Picture 2> (character reference for <Subject 2>): attribute_transfer — the character's visual attributes are transferred to the snowy battle environment with new poses and actions.\n\ndetailed_description: The target video is in a cinematic epic xianxia style with cold blue-grey color grading, dramatic backlighting, and heavy atmospheric snow particles. [Shot 1] A wide establishing shot shows the jagged snow-covered peak of a mountain surrounded by swirling mist and falling snow. <Subject 1> stands on the left side of the frame, barefoot with chains dragging in the snow, holding a dark plain sword in a low ready stance. <Subject 2> stands on the right, her green robes and blue sleeves billowing in the wind, holding a slender glowing sword in a formal guard position. The camera slowly pushes in with medium amplitude at slow speed as both fighters grip their hilts and prepare to draw. Snow swirls around their feet. [Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a medium tracking shot as both swords flash from their sheaths and the fighters charge. The camera trucks left and right following the rapid exchange — blades meet with bright sparks, snow explodes outward from each impact. <Subject 1> moves with surprising speed despite his chains, his strikes heavy and powerful. <Subject 2> counters with fluid, graceful parries, her sleeves trailing like water. The camera shakes slightly with each heavy clash. [Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the shot transitions to a dramatic low-angle shot looking up as both cultivators leap high into the air above the mountain peak. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> soar through the snowstorm, suspended mid-air, and exchange multiple rapid rounds of sword combat. Their blades clash repeatedly, leaving glowing arcs of sword qi trailing through the falling snow. The camera arcs around them with large amplitude at medium speed, capturing the aerial ballet from multiple angles — <Subject 1>'s raw primal power against <Subject 2>'s precise fluid technique, perfectly matched. Snowflakes catch the light of their sword glow. [Shot 4] At 00:12.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up as both fighters descend from above, each striking with full force from opposite directions. Their swords lock together hilt-to-hilt in a powerful cross, blades grinding against each other with showering sparks. Both push with all their might — <Subject 1>'s face tense with primal effort, <Subject 2>'s jaw set with determined focus. Snow swirls violently around them in the impact wind. They are evenly matched, a perfect draw. The camera holds static on the crossed blades and their locked eyes as the video ends.\n\noverall_soundscape: Howling mountain wind roars continuously, driven by heavy snowfall. The ring of steel echoes with each sword clash, accompanied by bright metallic impact sounds and showering sparks. Chains rattle and drag through the snow with the old man's movements. Fabric rustles loudly as robes and sleeves whip in the wind. Distant snow avalanches rumble faintly in the background. Heavy breathing from both fighters becomes audible during the final blade lock.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Epic orchestral score with taiko drums and erhu, starting slow and tense with low strings and percussion building steadily. The rhythm intensifies during the aerial battle with rapid drum beats and soaring string melodies. The music reaches its climax at the final blade lock, then holds on a sustained, resonant note that fades slowly."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-92.28016662597656, -850.3198852539062], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [8], "label": "posit